                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-9-9c2.52 0 4.85.83 6.72 2.24"/><path d="M21 3v6h-6"/></svg>
